gHv(){return"\u2022 Ctrl+K opens search. On Mac, Cmd+K.\n\u2022 Tab moves focus.\n\u2022 Up and down move the cursor.\n\u2022 Left or right enter the event tasks and button, or leave them. Up and down move through them. Space or Enter activates them.\n\u2022 Enter opens. Space marks for export.\n\u2022 Ctrl+Left or Ctrl+Right opens or closes the menu. The menu key does the same.\n\u2022 Delete removes.\n\u2022 Escape closes. If a form has changes, it asks for confirmation.\n\u2022 On a wheel, up and down change the value.\n\u2022 Alt+Left or Alt+Right change page."},
